API sketch: 
@stream_handler(checkpoint_store=my_store, max_retries=3, idempotency_key_fn=lambda ctx: ctx.request_id)
def on_event(evt: ChatEvent, control: StreamControl):
    if evt.type == 'delta':
        process_delta(evt.text)
    elif evt.type == 'function_call':
        handle_function(evt)

Rationale: decorator hides socket/HTTP plumbing and surfaces two things to user: typed events and a control object for pause/resume/cancel
